nger slide around in their playspace\n* Fixed other player's animations malfunctioning when you die\n* Norn damage scaling bugfix\n* Fixed walk tutorial showing every time you start the game\n* Beam spells deal 2x more damage\n* Audio bug when other player opens their inventory fixed\n* HUD hearts & mana swirls further back for comfort\n* Multiplayer stability fix", "created_date": 1770292933, "id": "26465631803022686", "version": "0.000695", "version_code": 695, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7631852763493874", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26465631803022686"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1769776837, "id": "26411675545084979", "version": "0.000694", "version_code": 694, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}